=== kraken2
--- kraken2 --re
--report-minimizer-data 	with --report, report minimizer and distinct minimizer counts too
--report-zero-counts 	with --report, report counts for ALL taxa, even if counts are zero
--report=	print a report with aggregate counts/clade to file
--- kraken2 --db data/
data/cfdb/
data/k2db/
--- kraken2 --paired data/
data/cfdb/
data/genomes.fna 
data/k2db/
data/reads_1.fq.gz 
data/reads_2.fq.gz 
--- kraken2-build --download-library 
UniVec 
UniVec_Core 
archaea 
bacteria 
fungi 
human 
nr 
nt 
plant 
plasmid 
protozoa 
viral 
--- kraken2-build --add-to-library data/
data/cfdb/
data/genomes.fna 
data/k2db/
--- kraken2-inspect --
--db=	name for Kraken 2 DB
--help 	print this message
--report-zero-counts 	report counts for ALL taxa, even if counts are zero
--skip-counts 	only print database summary statistics
--threads=	number of threads to use
--use-mpa-style 	format output like Kraken 1's kraken-mpa-report
--version 	print version information
--- k2 
add-to-library 	add file(s) to library
build 	build a database from library
classify 	classify a set of sequences
clean 	removes unwanted files from database
download-library 	download and build a special database
download-taxonomy 	download NCBI taxonomic information
inspect 	inspect Kraken 2 database(s)
merge-classifications 	merge classification results for different databases
