=== motus
--- motus 
calc_mgc 	calculate marker gene cluster (MGC) abundance
calc_motu 	summarize MGC abundances into a mOTU profile
classify 	classify user genomes into mOTUs
download 	download sequence files from mOTUs-db
downloadMGDB 	download the mOTUs marker gene database
genomes 	search the mOTUs-db by keyword (taxonomic, functional)
map_tax 	map reads to the marker gene database
merge 	merge multiple taxonomic profiling results into one table
prep_long 	prepare long reads to be profiled by mOTUs
profile 	perform taxonomic profiling (map_tax + calc_mgc + calc_motu) in a single step
--- motus profile -
--skip-pair-check 	skip validation that forward and reverse read headers match
-db 	alternative path for the mOTUs marker gene database
-f 	input file(s) for reads in forward orientation, fastQ/A(.gz)-formatted
-g 	number of marker genes for a mOTU to be present: 1 higher recall, 6 precision, 10 maximum
-h 	show the help of the command
-l 	minimum length of the alignment (bp)
-n 	sample name
-o 	output file name
-r 	input file(s) for reads in reverse orientation, fastQ/A(.gz)-formatted
-s 	input file(s) for unpaired reads, fastQ/A(.gz)-formatted
-t 	number of threads
-y 	which scale the abundances are reported in
--- motus profile -f data/
data/cfdb/
data/genomes.fna 
data/k2db/
data/reads_1.fq.gz 
data/reads_2.fq.gz 
--- motus profile -y 
BASE_NORM 
BASE_RAW 
INSERT_NORM 
INSERT_RAW 
INSERT_SCALED 
--- motus calc_mgc -i data/
data/cfdb/
data/k2db/
data/sample.bam 
--- motus genomes -d 
EGGNOG 
KEGG 
PFAM 
TAXONOMY 
--- motus download -t 
antismash 
eggnog 
gene_faa 
gene_fna 
gene_gff 
genome 
kegg 
pfam 
